WEBVTT

00:00:05.581 --> 00:00:09.178
Choose Donations in the side menu.

00:00:09.428 --> 00:00:12.705
Click addondemo06.

00:00:12.955 --> 00:00:17.690
Check that Needs review
shows beside the reference.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:23.881
Check that Expected ₦15,000, paid
₦10,000. shows under the reference.

00:00:24.131 --> 00:00:30.131
Type "Checked Paystack in test mode.
The amounts match." in the Note box.

00:00:32.872 --> 00:00:36.319
Click Accept the gift.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:41.842
Check that Gift accepted shows
at the bottom of the screen.
